description:
Simple Ruby Service is a lightweight framework for creating Services and Service Objects (SOs) in Ruby. The framework provides a simple DSL that:
  a) incorporates ActiveModel validations and error handling;
  b) encourages a succinct, idiomatic coding style;
  c) allows Service Objects to ducktype as Procs.

This gem allows kubernetes monitoring your app while it is running migrates and after it started.
Features:
* add routes /_readiness and /_liveness on rails stack by default;
* allow custom checks for /_readiness and /_liveness on rails stack;
* add routes /_readiness and /_liveness while rake db:migrate runs.

